        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty\r\nCarrigbán\r\nCurraghavoe \r\nMitchelstown   \r\nCo. Cork  \r\nP67 D232\r\n\r\n7/8-Bedroom House. Circa. 294m2 / c.3164sqft\r\nGuide: €450,000\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present new to the market, this immaculately presented 7/8-bedroom family home within an area of outstanding natural beauty. Bright spacious living accommodation, a superb location only 5 minutes from Mitchelstown town centre on the foothills of the Galtee Mountains. A short commute from Cork, Limerick & Clonmel. Viewing strictly by appointment. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nLocated just off the R665 Clonmel Rd, minutes from Mitchelstown town centre with its wealth of amenities, Living Health Clinic, schools & shops. This property is just 5.9km from Junction 12 of the M8 Motorway & just 35minutes from the Jack Lynch Tunnel.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n7/8-bedroom detached house.\r\nWell finished & maintained.\r\nGarage & Sunroom, Patio, Fruit trees \r\nTarmacadam Drive, Electric gates \r\nCirca. 294m2 / c.3164sqft\r\nWired for back-up generator.\r\nSubstantial c.1 acre site.\r\nDetached garage. CCTV\r\nOFCH. Septic tank, water.\r\nJ12 M8 Motorway 5minutes.\r\nJack Lynch Tunnel 35mins.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation: Ground Floor\r\nEntrance hallway   \r\n4.355m x 2.068m\r\n14.29ft x 6.78ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\nLivingroom    \r\n4.119m x 5.731m\r\n13.51ft x 18.80ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\nSolid fuel stove\r\nBlinds\r\nCornicing\r\nLight fitting\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\n5.215m x 4.176m\r\n17.11ft x 13.70ft\r\nWall & floor units\r\nFloor tiles\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\nBuilt in oven/microwave.\r\nGas hob extractor.\r\nRecessed lighting\r\nCornicing.\r\n\r\n\r\nDining room\r\n3.622m x 3.402m\r\n11.88ft x 11.16ft\r\nFeature brick fireplace & archway.\r\nLarge back boiler stove.\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nRadiator\r\nPower points.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSunroom    \r\n4.513m x 4.344m\r\n14.81ft x 14.25ft\r\nTimber floor.\r\nPower points.\r\nBlinds, French doors.\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility\r\n3.482m x 2.067m\r\n11.42ft x 6.78ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nPlumbed for utilities.\r\nPower points.\r\nRadiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n3.28m x 1.93m\r\n10`9`` x 6`4``\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nWC & vanity.\r\nTiled around bath.\r\nBathtub.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\n5.292m x 3.996m\r\n17.36ft x 13.11ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\nBuilt in wardrobe\r\nBlinds\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\n2.476m x 0.956m\r\n8.12ft x 3.14ft\r\nFloor tiles\r\nWC & toilet\r\nShower (tiled around)\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.716m x 3.396m\r\n12.19ft x 11.14ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\nBlinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.090m x 4.008m\r\n10.14ft x 13.15ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.940m x 3.983m\r\n9.65ft x 13.07ft\r\nTimber floor\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\n3.983m x 2.940m\r\n13.07ft x 9.65ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nShower & WHB\r\n(No toilet)\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nBedroom 5 \r\n3.549m x 2.89m\r\n20.32ft x 9.48ft \r\nCarpet.\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\nBedroom 6 \r\n6.194m x 2.890m\r\n17.70ft x 9.46ft\r\nCarpet.\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 7 \r\n5.394m x 2.883m\r\n17.70ft x 9.46ft\r\nCarpet.\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.93m x 2.469m\r\n9.62ft x 8.10ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nWHB & Toilet.\r\nVanity sink.\r\nRadiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 8/lounge\r\n6.567m x 5.917m\r\n21.55ft x 19.41ft\r\nCarpet.\r\nPower points\r\nRadiator\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms:\r\nGuide: €450,000\r\nThis property is being offered for Sale by private treaty. Terms are available and to   be negotiated on application with agents:\r\n\r\nMichael Dorgan \r\nAuctioneers & Valuers\r\nBaldwin Street\r\nMitchelstown\r\nCo. Cork\r\n\r\n(025) 85700\r\nEmail: Info@michaeldorgan . i e\r\n\r\nViewing: Strictly by Appointment only.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Michael Dorgan, Auctioneers & Valuers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars but the company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. Potential purchasers must clarify all information contained within marketing documents with their own engineers/surveyors and solicitors. Failure to do so cannot be considered the agents liability.\r\n\r\n All reasonable offers will be submitted to vendors. These particulars do not form any contract for Sale or lease subsequently entered into.\r\nInformation gathered from public sources may be subject to copy write, we are happy to acknowledge same if it becomes known to us.\r\n\r\nAny form of this brochure may not be reused"
